{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Give a portion.</b> The essence of seven in Scripture is as the author of Sefer Yetzirah said, and the Holy Sanctuary is directed in the middle, and he said for eight corresponding to the days of the week, for the eighth day is like the day that began it, and the matter is continuous without interruption. And the meaning of \"what evil will be\" is that it may come upon him in poverty, and he said \"it will be with evil with it,\" for she will be a young virgin."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:06.186973713Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}